---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="Read how affiliate links are used on Kreativ Auto and what that means for recommendations on the site.">
  <div class="container-shell py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="surface p-8 sm:p-10">
      <p class="eyebrow">Disclosure</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Affiliate disclosure</h1>
      <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-steel">
        <p>Some links on Kreativ Auto may be affiliate links. That means the site may earn a commission if a reader clicks through and makes a purchase.</p>
        <p>This does not change the price a reader pays. It does mean the site can be supported when its recommendations are useful.</p>
        <p>Kreativ Auto also participates in the Amazon Associates Program, which means qualifying Amazon purchases may earn the site a commission.</p>
        <p>Affiliate relationships do not guarantee that a product will be recommended. The goal is still to point readers toward sensible options, not simply the highest-priced one.</p>
        <p>Fitment, trim level, engine configuration, and exact part compatibility should always be checked before buying.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
